{"c":[{"name":"20261006T172603Z-a7ca0252d9058e55","text":"Once an assistive app turns on Chrome's web accessibility, native ghost text sees page fields, but Chrome ignores its AX writes (writeIgnored): Tab is eaten. HostCoordinator yields to page inline text via PageInline.nativeYields.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T211151Z-05df8b8f447e91f6","text":"H14: PageTaskMachine.publish must invalidate its own live offer before republishing (a click changes the preview without a key): otherwise the arbiter's onDisplaced puts the whole page task away.","type":"note"}]}
